[[Refined Homestead Fiber]] is a [[crafting material]] used for [[Homestead]] [[Decoration|decorations]]. It is obtained by refining common [[ingredient]]s at the [[Homestead Refinement—Farm]]. 

== Acquisition ==
=== Sold by ===
* Without upgrades, limited to 200 purchase per account per week. This limit increases by 100 for each {{rarity|Masterwork}} and {{rarity|Rare}} [[Homestead Upgrade: Fiber Trade Capacity]] and 150 for each {{rarity|Exotic}} [[Homestead Upgrade: Fiber Trade Capacity]] unlocked from the [[Homestead Refinement—Farm]].
* Fully upgraded, limited up to 800 purchase per account per week. You can get up to 1600 Refined Homestead Fiber each week.<ref group="note">This count does not include the [[Homestead Refinement—Farm#Black Market—Fiber|Black Market]].</ref> With two [[Homestead Upgrade: Fiber Trade Efficiency|efficiency upgrades]], Black Peppercorn, Vanilla Bean, Head of Lettuce, Onion, Sage Leaf, Raspberry, Saffron Thread, Pile of Flax Seeds, Orrian Truffle, and Seaweed each offer twice as much Fiber as other types.
